    "notes": "ORNITH 1.0 — DeepReinforce family (9B Dense / 31B Dense / 35B MoE / 397B MoE + GGUF + FP8 variants). Self-improving training framework jointly learns solutions + task-specific harnesses (scaffold-as-policy). Built on Gemma 4 + Qwen 3.5 pretrained backbones. ORNITH-1.0-397B Terminal-Bench 2.1 77.5 + SWE-Verified 82.4 — beats Opus 4.7 (70.3 / 80.8) but below Opus 4.8 (85 / 87.6). ORNITH-1.0-9B fits edge devices yet matches Gemma 4-31B / Qwen 3.6-35B. CoffeeBench (Sakana AI x KPMG Azusa, ICML 2026 Workshop Failure Modes in Agentic AI): 6-agent (2 farmers, 2 roasters, 2 retailers) 90-day coffee supply-chain simulation. Evaluation = net profit at simulation end. Agent under test runs Roaster A; other 5 fixed to Sonnet 4.6. Mean of 3 runs per model. Key finding: Claude Haiku 4.5 stalls in 'thinking-without-acting' regime — analyses but only calls wait_for_next_day(), loses to passive baseline."
  },
